\pard\plain\page\keepn\sb0\sa280\qc\f2\b\fs52\cf2 tsbRapidFX\par
\pard\plain\keepn\sb400\sa140\f2\b\fs34\cf2 The Complete Manual\par
\pard\plain\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs21\cf1\qj A Basic for the JVM \u8212? the language, the compiler, the Java class library, databases, user interfaces, web applications, the form designers for the desktop, the web and mobile, and packaging into native installers.\par
\pard\plain\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs21\cf1\qj It is all one product now: {\b one IntelliJ IDEA plugin} carries the language, the three designers and tsbDeploy. The separate mobile plugin for Android Studio is gone since 19.09.2026; where older notes still say "Android Studio", read "the IDE".\par
\pard\plain\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs21\cf1\qj This manual describes tsbRapidFX as it stands. Every program in it was compiled by the real {\f1\fs18 rfxc} before it was printed, and the ones that produce output were run. Where a thing does not work yet, the manual says so rather than describing what it ought to do.\par
\pard\sb160\sa160\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw8\brdrcf4\par
