\pard\plain\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs21\cf1\qj {\f1\fs18 JLabel} plus {\f1\fs18 ImageIcon} does not scale at all, and {\f1\fs18 Image.getScaledInstance} is the old area-averaging filter: slow, lazy, and it redoes the work on every repaint. Neither keeps the proportions or knows about a high-resolution screen. That is why {\f1\fs18 ShowPicture} exists, with {\f1\fs18 Fit}, {\f1\fs18 Fill}, {\f1\fs18 Stretch} and {\f1\fs18 Original}.\par
